0..80 Comment "/// This source states an identity system for a unit atom that the module seals."
81..84 Comment "///"
85..160 Comment "/// Its relation and transport law make evidence between two points a path."
161..164 Comment "///"
165..228 Comment "/// The `identity` attribute installs the relation as identity."
229..294 Comment "/// The checker uses the transport law to relate the atom points."
